This release upgrades the existing patch under app.hiro.tiktoklink.patches.
It replaces the two explicitly inventoried JVM loader entries of Link Direct 1.0.0
and the corresponding owned DEX loader definitions. All unrelated loader definitions,
JVM entries, runtime extensions, resources and prior notices are preserved.
The new notice is added at META-INF/hiro-tiktok-link-direct101/.

Corresponding new source, build tooling, actual-APK validation evidence and publication
procedures are included in the sources_and_QA archive and at:
https://github.com/hiro191u3n2/hiro-morphe-patches/tree/tiktok-link-v1.0.1/releases/tiktok-link-direct101

The exact baseline is Hiro Morphe Patches v1.0.307:
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hiro191u3n2/hiro-morphe-patches/a2c40d4bc698acab741431475273e0b0bb8a444b/downloads/Hiro_Morphe_Patches_v1.0.307.mpp
SHA-256: 6c9210cc6edf52078e2d12883a1dcd66d47f64870b108b7d858fbddc3c052119

